# Station cards (Edge of Eternities, Star Trek): the threshold rows at the bottom of the text box, each with
# a round "N+" badge at the left edge and a tinted band behind it. Up to two rows.
# Files:
#   game_fields  the four card fields, included by magic.mse-game (patched in by tools\make-slim-data.ps1)
#   script       layout functions, included in each frame's init script; the frame defines station_bottom and station_rules_size
#   card_fields  field layout, bands, badges and the P/T box centre, included at the top level of each frame
# The PNGs are drawn by tools\make-station-assets.ps1; edit that script, not the images.
# Card file keys: "station 1 threshold: 6+", "station 1 text: Flying", and the same with 2.
